00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:21.739
In this busy time, give us calm, give us peace.

00:00:21.739 --> 00:00:27.739
Help us to set aside the troubles of the day that we carried with us to this place.

00:00:27.739 --> 00:00:32.219
So we can be present to one another and to you.

00:00:32.219 --> 00:00:38.020
We seek your blessing as we share ideas, progress, and accomplishments,

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:41.829
and go about doing the work you've called us to do.

00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:46.770
You've charged us with being your hands and feet here on earth

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:52.810
for seeing opportunities in many circumstances, both big and small.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:58.450
And so please reveal to us through our discussion and decisions

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.920
what you would have us do.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:06.959
If we have differences, help us to resolve those in a manner that leaves everyone's dignity

00:01:06.959 --> 00:01:12.790
in place, and with a solution that brings light into our community.

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:22.189
Help us to have the strength to carry out your mission of love, justice, peace, and gratitude in our community.

00:01:22.189 --> 00:01:25.189
This day and always.

00:01:25.189 --> 00:01:30.189
We ask this through your Son, our Savior, Jesus Christ.

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:31.189
Amen.

